    <string name="test_attempts">Attempts per site</string>
    <string name="test_status_hint">Any HTTP answer, even 404 or 403, means the connection got through DPI: the status is what the server itself replied. A block shows up as a reset, a timeout, a stalled or truncated response, a wrong certificate or a redirect to a block page.</string>
