    <string name="test_udp">UDP: QUIC and calls (%1$d)</string>
    <string name="test_udp_hint">Each site is checked over QUIC (HTTP/3, UDP 443): a QUIC Initial with the site name is sent and any server reply counts as passed. STUN servers used by calls are checked too: %1$s. Without root, UDP desync means fake datagrams with a low TTL before the real ones.</string>
